msgstr "Termik kazanç"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC Gain"
msgstr "TC Kazanım"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altitude gained/lost in the current thermal."
msgstr "Mevcut termikte kazanılan/yitirilen yükseklik."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Magnetic track reported by the GPS. (Touch-screen/PC only) If this InfoBox "
